        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur ARCFAV19ENTR, Half-Round Fifth Avenue Knob with Arc Tall Plate Entryset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Half-Round Knob with Arc Tall Plate Entryset is a beautiful pairing of traditional styles for an end look that is chic. The Arc Tall Plate Entrance Set with Fifth Avenue Knob will fit in with almost any design style, and by selecting one of the available finish options, you'll be able to match this front door lock to your style. The Half-Round Fifth Avenue Knob with Arc Tall Plate Entryset is a single cylinder handleset that boasts security, style, and an easy installation. It will fit most standard pre-drilled doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets that are 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Single Cylinder Entry Set:</b> The deadbolt is thrown and retracted by key from the exterior and by turn unit on the interior. A knob operates the door latch from both interior and the exterior.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nWant your entire house to have matching hardware? Also Available <a href=\"/products/fifth-avenue-knob-with-arc-tall-plate-grandeur-arcfav19\"><b>Fifth Avenue Knob with Arc Tall Plate for Interior Doors</b></a> in Privacy, Passage, and Dummy Functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur Half Round Fifth Avenue Knob with Arc Tall Plate Keyed Door Lock:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Keyway: Schlage \"C\"</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Keyed Entry Set Fifth Avenue Knob with Arc Tall Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.24\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.24\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Projection: .39\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Centers: 8-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-ARCFAV19ENTR-specifications.pdf?v=1704262396\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur ARCFAV19ENTR Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
